// expect-error: waited on but never initialized
// BUG-849: a Barrier zero-initialises to target 0, and `_zer_barrier_wait` then
// returns on the FIRST arrival — every thread sails through and the barrier
// reports success while providing no synchronization at all. Worse than the
// arena case: a dead arena at least fails visibly; a dead barrier succeeds.
Barrier b;
u32 main() {
    @barrier_wait(b);
    return 0;
}
